\text{\% increase} = \left( \frac{A_{12} - A_{10}}{A_{10}} \right) \times 100 = \left( \frac{36\pi - 25\pi}{25\pi} \right) \times 100 = \left( \frac{11\pi}{25\pi} \right) \times 100 = \left( \frac{11}{25} \right) \times 100 = 44\% \text{.}
